# DocFlow export-file adapter — purchase order (ICD-08 IF-48). File name = <idem_key>.csv; UTF-8 with BOM; separator ';'.
# One H (header) row, N L (line) rows, all keyed by idem_key. Amounts use '.' decimals and no thousands separators; dates ISO 8601.
# The ERP import MUST reject a file whose idem_key was imported before; DocFlow re-exports the identical file on retry.
# The import job answers with <idem_key>.ack (ERP reference) or <idem_key>.nak (reason).
rec;idem_key;doc_kind;doc_number;doc_date;supplier_erp_ref;currency;subtotal;tax;total;delivery_date;incoterm;approved_by;approved_at;source_document_id;source_sha256
